WEBVTT

00:00.600 --> 00:05.400
Great ideas don't grow alone.
They grow with people who see things differently.

00:05.750 --> 00:11.220
At StartBeside, find your people,
and turn that first idea into a real startup.

00:11.500 --> 00:15.150
Start small, build together,
and see how far you can go.

00:16.650 --> 00:19.100
StartBeside. Don't build alone.
